WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:06.029
Here’s an SCP that’ll give you a serious
case of the Mondays: SCP-3166, a disgusting

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:08.069
monster also known as Gorefield.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:13.090
It looks like a giant, ratty fursuit of the
character Garfield, from the popular Jim Davis

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:17.780
comic strip of the same name, but the suit
is made out of real cat fur, and its insides

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.840
are made from putrid, human-flesh lasagna
that is somehow a genetic match for Jim Davis

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:23.840
himself.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.350
Whenever the Garfield franchise isn’t doing
well, financially or in its public image,

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.619
this monster manifests and begins stalking
someone associated with the brand.

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:36.780
If it catches them before the SCP Foundation
can intercept, it’ll either beat them to

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:41.030
death or force-feed them the lasagna from
its own body until they die.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:46.120
The only way to distract the beast is to leave
some fresh lasagna of your own laying around,

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.570
which the beast will immediately take as bait.

